### ============ FAVORITOS ============

### Toggle favorito (agrega/quita)
POST {{base_url}}/favoritos/:prestadorId
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Mis favoritos
GET {{base_url}}/favoritos?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

